    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n4 Bedrooms | Generous Site | Large Rear Garden | Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant Eligible\n\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present Shannon Road, Mountrath—a substantial and fully habitable four-bedroom home set on a particularly generous site, offering considerable potential for purchasers to modernise and make it their own over time.\n\nThe property benefits from an exceptionally long rear garden, off-street parking and a selection of useful outbuildings. The extensive outdoor space is ideal for family life, gardening, storage or workshop use and may offer potential for extension or further development, subject to the necessary planning permission.\n\nInternally, the accommodation is well proportioned and arranged over two levels. A bright entrance hall leads to a comfortable living room featuring an attractive fireplace, while the spacious kitchen and dining area provides ample room for family living and entertaining, with fitted cabinetry and direct access to the rear.\n\nThere are four bedrooms in total, including two generously sized ground-floor bedrooms. This flexible layout could suit a variety of needs, including family living, working from home or guest accommodation. A well-sized main bathroom completes the interior.\n\nWhile the property would benefit from modernisation, it is fully habitable in its current condition, allowing a new owner to make improvements gradually and according to their own tastes and requirements.\n\nA significant attraction for prospective purchasers is the property's eligibility for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant. Funding of up to 50,000 may be available to qualifying applicants, subject to the relevant scheme terms, eligibility requirements and approval.\n\nLocated in an established residential setting close to the amenities of Mountrath, this deceptively spacious property represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families, investors or anyone looking for a spacious home with genuine potential to modernise and make their own.\n\nWhy View Shannon Road?\n\nSubstantial four-bedroom home offered at 259,000\nFully habitable in its current condition\nEligible for funding of up to 50,000 under the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to applicant eligibility, scheme terms and approval\nExceptionally long rear garden\nGenerous overall site\nMultiple outbuildings offering excellent storage or workshop space\nTwo ground-floor bedrooms providing flexible accommodation\nOff-street parking\nPotential to extend or further develop, subject to planning permission\nConvenient Mountrath location\nAn opportunity to modernise and further enhance a substantial home to your own requirements"
      },
